---
description: Keep StagePin UI copy concise and functional
globs: mobile/src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI copy

- Use short, descriptive feature headings such as 공연·예매 일정, 새로 올라온 굿즈, 현장 교환.
- Do not add decorative subtitles, slogans, or emotional marketing copy under headings or in banners (e.g. 누군가의 보물이 내 최애가 되는 순간).
- Keep essential source attribution, demo disclosures, validation, loading, and error guidance.
- Home section navigation belongs to the right of the heading, with dark text and the label 전체 보기 >. Keep a context-specific accessibility label.
